              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "wjp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love it! This is our go to side dish for barbecues. I follow recipe as posted, but make a sauce of all ingredients except yams. I pour the sauce over the chunks of baked yams (or sweet potatoes) and mix until some of the chunks are mashed. We prefer this chunky texture over a puree.",
