            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BOOKMARKER"
            },
            "reviewBody": "12.25.12 ... https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/216548/chipotle-garnet-yams/ ... These were more interesting than good. No, not bad; just didn't say \"Mmmm!\" with the first bite. 'More an \"Ohhh\" :D I used 3c mashed sweet potatoes, 1T chiles in paste (pureed), 2T each butter &amp; brown sugar. No heavy cream. I may try it with corn. I like sweet &amp; spicy together, but with sweets just didn't grab me.12/12 Tried the corn switch. Pretty good. Used 2T ea chipolte peppers, sugar, butter, cream with 3cans corn. Still a little too hot to have more than a few bites. 1T w 2cans might work better. 'Glad I tried it. Note4Me: 1# frozen corn, 1T butter, 1T heavy cream, 1T chipotle puree, 1t sugar. Try 1 1/2t chipotle puree.",
